{
  "provider": {
    "version": 0,
    "block": {
      "attributes": {
        "api_key": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "The API key for the Novu provider",
          "description_kind": "markdown",
          "optional": true,
          "sensitive": true
        },
        "api_url": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "The API URL for the Novu provider. Overrides eu_region (default:SDK default, US: https://api.novu.co as of provider v1.0.0)",
          "description_kind": "markdown",
          "optional": true
        },
        "eu_region": {
          "type": "bool",
          "description": "Whether the provider should use the EU region API (default: false)",
          "description_kind": "markdown",
          "optional": true
        }
      },
      "description": "A minimal Terraform provider for managing some [Novu](https://novu.co) resources.",
      "description_kind": "markdown"
    }
  },
  "resource_schemas": {
    "novu_fcm_integration": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "active": {
            "type": "bool",
            "description": "Whether the integration is active",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true,
            "computed": true
          },
          "check": {
            "type": "bool",
            "description": "Whether the integration is checked. It is recommended to set this to true.",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "ID of the integration",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "identifier": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Identifier of the integration",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true
          },
          "json_configuration": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "JSON configuration of the integration",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Name of the integration",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true
          },
          "service_account": {
            "nested_type": {
              "attributes": {
                "auth_provider_x509_cert_url": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Auth provider X509 cert URL of the service account",
                  "description_kind": "markdown",
                  "required": true
                },
                "auth_uri": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Auth URI of the service account",
                  "description_kind": "markdown",
                  "required": true
                },
                "client_email": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Client email of the service account",
                  "description_kind": "markdown",
                  "required": true
                },
                "client_id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Client ID of the service account",
                  "description_kind": "markdown",
                  "required": true
                },
                "client_x509_cert_url": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Client X509 cert URL of the service account",
                  "description_kind": "markdown",
                  "required": true
                },
                "private_key": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Private key of the service account",
                  "description_kind": "markdown",
                  "required": true
                },
                "private_key_id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Private key ID of the service account",
                  "description_kind": "markdown",
                  "required": true
                },
                "project_id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Project ID of the service account",
                  "description_kind": "markdown",
                  "required": true
                },
                "token_uri": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Token URI of the service account",
                  "description_kind": "markdown",
                  "required": true
                },
                "type": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Type of the service account",
                  "description_kind": "markdown",
                  "required": true
                }
              },
              "nesting_mode": "single"
            },
            "description": "FCM service account",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true
          }
        },
        "description": "FCM Integration",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    },
    "novu_workflow": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "active": {
            "type": "bool",
            "description": "Whether the workflow is active",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true,
            "computed": true
          },
          "created_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Last updated timestamp",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "description of the workflow",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true,
            "computed": true
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "database identifier of the workflow",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "last_triggered_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Timestamp of the last workflow trigger",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Name of the workflow",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          },
          "origin": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Origin of the workflow",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "slug": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Slug of the workflow",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Status of the workflow",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "steps": {
            "nested_type": {
              "attributes": {
                "push_step": {
                  "nested_type": {
                    "attributes": {
                      "control_values": {
                        "nested_type": {
                          "attributes": {
                            "body": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "Body content of the push notification. The push step will have an error if it is not set.",
                              "description_kind": "markdown",
                              "optional": true
                            },
                            "subject": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "Subject/title of the push notification. The push step will have an error if it is not set.",
                              "description_kind": "markdown",
                              "optional": true
                            }
                          },
                          "nesting_mode": "single"
                        },
                        "description": "Control values of the push step",
                        "description_kind": "markdown",
                        "optional": true
                      },
                      "id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "ID of the push step",
                        "description_kind": "markdown",
                        "computed": true
                      },
                      "issues": {
                        "nested_type": {
                          "attributes": {
                            "controls": {
                              "nested_type": {
                                "attributes": {
                                  "issue_type": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "description": "Type of step content issue",
                                    "description_kind": "markdown",
                                    "computed": true
                                  },
                                  "key": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "description": "Key of the control issue",
                                    "description_kind": "markdown",
                                    "computed": true
                                  },
                                  "message": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "description": "Detailed message describing the issue",
                                    "description_kind": "markdown",
                                    "computed": true
                                  },
                                  "variable_name": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "description": "Name of the variable that caused the issue",
                                    "description_kind": "markdown",
                                    "computed": true
                                  }
                                },
                                "nesting_mode": "list"
                              },
                              "description": "Controls-related issues",
                              "description_kind": "markdown",
                              "computed": true
                            },
                            "integration": {
                              "nested_type": {
                                "attributes": {
                                  "issue_type": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "description": "Type of integration issue",
                                    "description_kind": "markdown",
                                    "computed": true
                                  },
                                  "key": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "description": "Key of the integration issue",
                                    "description_kind": "markdown",
                                    "computed": true
                                  },
                                  "message": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "description": "Detailed message describing the issue",
                                    "description_kind": "markdown",
                                    "computed": true
                                  },
                                  "variable_name": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "description": "Name of the variable that caused the issue",
                                    "description_kind": "markdown",
                                    "computed": true
                                  }
                                },
                                "nesting_mode": "list"
                              },
                              "description": "Integration-related issues",
                              "description_kind": "markdown",
                              "computed": true
                            }
                          },
                          "nesting_mode": "single"
                        },
                        "description": "Issues associated with the push step",
                        "description_kind": "markdown",
                        "computed": true
                      },
                      "name": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Name of the push step",
                        "description_kind": "markdown",
                        "required": true
                      },
                      "origin": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Origin of the push step",
                        "description_kind": "markdown",
                        "computed": true
                      },
                      "slug": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Slug of the push step",
                        "description_kind": "markdown",
                        "computed": true
                      },
                      "step_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "ID of the push step",
                        "description_kind": "markdown",
                        "computed": true
                      },
                      "workflow_database_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Workflow database ID of the push step",
                        "description_kind": "markdown",
                        "computed": true
                      },
                      "workflow_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Workflow ID of the push steps",
                        "description_kind": "markdown",
                        "computed": true
                      }
                    },
                    "nesting_mode": "single"
                  },
                  "description": "Push step",
                  "description_kind": "markdown",
                  "optional": true
                }
              },
              "nesting_mode": "list"
            },
            "description": "Ordered list of steps of the workflow. NB : For now, only push steps are supported.",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true,
            "computed": true
          },
          "tags": {
            "type": [
              "list",
              "string"
            ],
            "description": "Tags associated with the workflow",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true,
            "computed": true
          },
          "updated_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Last updated timestamp",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "validate_payload": {
            "type": "bool",
            "description": "Whether the payload schema validation is enabled",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true,
            "computed": true
          },
          "workflow_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Unique identifier of the workflow",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "required": true
          }
        },
        "description": "Workflow resource. Manage any workflow within the organization.",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    }
  },
  "data_source_schemas": {
    "novu_api_key": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "environment_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The environment id",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true
          },
          "hash": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The api key hash",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "owner_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "ID of the user that owns the api key",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          },
          "value": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The api key value",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true,
            "sensitive": true
          }
        },
        "description": "Api key data source. Retrieve a single API key for an environment if set, otherwise try to retrieve a single API key for all the environments within the organization. Will fail if multiple API keys are found.",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    },
    "novu_api_keys": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "environment_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The environment id",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "optional": true
          },
          "items": {
            "nested_type": {
              "attributes": {
                "environment_id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "The environment id",
                  "description_kind": "markdown",
                  "computed": true
                },
                "hash": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "The api key hash",
                  "description_kind": "markdown",
                  "computed": true
                },
                "owner_id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "ID of the user that owns the api key",
                  "description_kind": "markdown",
                  "computed": true
                },
                "value": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "The api key",
                  "description_kind": "markdown",
                  "computed": true,
                  "sensitive": true
                }
              },
              "nesting_mode": "list"
            },
            "description": "The environment's api keys",
            "description_kind": "markdown",
            "computed": true
          }
        },
        "description": "Api keys data source. Retrieve all the API keys for an environment if set, otherwise retrieve all the API keys for all the environments within the organization",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    },
